      "Use stable item_id values. If another item already represents the same work, update it instead of creating a duplicate.",
      "For language coverage, use defaults plus sparse tier/language/pair overrides. Never paste a 104x104 matrix.",
      "Keep integrity review, asset trust, lesson release, runtime availability, CI, and language coverage as independent fields.",
      "If work exists only on a branch/PR, record that exact ref and PR. Do not pretend it is on main.",
      "Append one rollcalls entry listing touched item IDs, exact refs/PRs, blockers, and next actions.",
      "If your chat discovers conflicting ownership or duplicate SSOTs, set the item blocked and record the conflict instead of silently choosing one."
