        "remaining blockers"
      ],
      "next_actions": [
        "next concrete actions"
      ],
      "notes": "optional"
    },
    "copyable_prompt": "ROLL CALL: Fetch the latest Clickabl/gef-lexicon main GEF_PROGRESS.json. Update only the items you actually worked on, preserving everyone else's entries. Map every claim to exact repo paths/branches/PRs, keep language coverage sparse and directional, keep Lexicon/Lexi/Content/Runtime/UI/Locales/Review/CI as separate statuses, and append one rollcalls entry for this chat."
